  "",
  "| Subtasks                                           | Topology                                     |",
  "| -------------------------------------------------- | -------------------------------------------- |",
  "| Clearly disjoint: no shared files, separate layers | Parallel worktrees and an integration branch |",
  "| Overlapping, dependent, or unsure                  | Stacked relay — the default                  |",
