  "",
  "## Per-stage contract",
  "",
  "| Stage           | Required spec fields                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            | Clauses                                     | Report must paste                                                                                                                                                                                                                                     |",
  "| --------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- | ------------------------------------------- | ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------- |",
